===Pronunciation===
*{{rhymes|ændəl}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro|en}} {{term|sandale|lang=fro}}, from {{etyl|lat|en}} {{term|sandalium|lang=lat}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|σανδάλιον|lang=grc|sc=Grek|tr=sandalion}}, diminutive of {{term|σάνδαλον|lang=grc|sc=Grek|tr=sandalon||sandal}}, probably ultimately from {{etyl|fa|en}} {{term|صندل|lang=fa|sc=fa-Arab|tr=sandal||sandal}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A type of open [[shoe]] made up of straps or bands holding a [[sole]] to the foot.

